      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-algebra-2003-p7.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "2003\nWe know that \\(x^{3}+x^{2}-333 x-1001=(x-a)(x-b)(x-c)=x^{3}-(a+b+c) x^{2}+\\) \\((a b+b c+c a) x-a b c\\). Also, \\((a+b+c)^{3}-3(a+b+c)(a b+b c+c a)+3 a b c=a^{3}+b^{3}+c^{3}\\). Thus, \\(a^{3}+b^{3}+c^{3}=(-1)^{3}-3(-1)(-333)+3 \\cdot 1001=2003\\).",
